{
  "name": "dsh-local-loop-fuse",
  "version": "0.8.2",
  "description": "DSH 循环护栏：① assistant-stream 字符重复检测（可 abort）；①b 低多样性高重复（抓「带噪声的交替空转」——① 线的精确匹配结构上抓不到它）；② 行动层「无进展」停滞检测；②b 同参工具调用连击（按**动作参数**判定，忽略 description 之类自注）；③ 反复卡住达阈值 ⇒ agent.cancel() 真切断；⑤ 零正文 turn（只有思考、正文为空）检测。",
  "type": "module",
  "main": "index.js",
  "exports": {
    ".": "./index.js",
    "./cordis.patch.yml": "./cordis.patch.yml",
    "./package.json": "./package.json"
  },
  "files": [
    "index.js",
    "cordis.patch.yml"
  ],
  "keywords": [
    "dsh",
    "dsh-plugin",
    "deepseek-harness",
    "loop",
    "guard",
    "ftllm"
  ],
  "license": "MIT",
  "dsh": {
    "bundle": {
      "patch": "./cordis.patch.yml"
    }
  },
  "engines": {
    "node": ">=20"
  },
  "repository": {
    "type": "git",
    "url": "git+https://github.com/zimuhuan-code/dsh-local-loop-fuse.git"
  },
  "homepage": "https://github.com/zimuhuan-code/dsh-local-loop-fuse#readme",
  "bugs": {
    "url": "https://github.com/zimuhuan-code/dsh-local-loop-fuse/issues"
  }
}
